      "body_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<h2 class=\"border-bottom mt2\">Description</h2>\n<div class=\"mb2\">\n<strong>27 Inch Top Load Washer with 4.5 cu. ft. Capacity</strong><br>Laundry day has never been effortless with Samsung's 4.5 cu. ft. capacity top load washer with Active WaterJet. Reduce the number of loads with its large capacity tub. Its Diamond Drum Interior is proven to provide a gentler clean, with tests showing that washing-related damages were reduced by up to 34% when compared to conventional washing machine drums. Its vibration reduction technology allows for quiet washing, making it a perfect choice for small homes with multi-purpose spaces. Remove the need to flip through your manual whenever you need to troubleshoot your washing machine with the Smart Care feature, which makes diagnosis and troubleshooting as easy as flashing your smartphone's camera on the error code flashing on the LED screen. This washer also comes with a Self Clean cycle for easier maintenance. Do more with Samsung's innovative washer.</div>\n</div>",
